# org-target: docs/10-19-design/10-architecture/10.20-evidence-arrival-and-scoped-review-recovery.org::#evidence-recovery-purpose
# render-layout: elk; theme: 0; pad: 24; timeout: 30
direction: down
classes: {
  owner: {style.fill: "#E6F5F3"; style.stroke: "#19756C"; style.border-radius: 10}
  design: {style.fill: "#EAF2FF"; style.stroke: "#315B8A"; style.border-radius: 10}
  boundary: {style.fill: "#FFF2DD"; style.stroke: "#9B6C25"; style.border-radius: 10}
}
library: "Existing owner roles / shared recovery DESIGN\nLibrary owns claims, obligations, rules and dependency contracts\nPOO Module / Profile specialize; Scenario captures actual inputs\nNo new evaluator, authority service or agent harness" {class: design}
agent: "LLM-based AI agent\nDiscover Library assets and missing premises\nChoose investigation, validation or repair branches\nPropose alternatives; no self-issued evidence authority" {class: design}
arrival: "Evidence arrival / REC01-REC03\nOriginal identity, bytes, claim and method\nSeparate production, arrival and effective time\nExact target / required dependencies / actual authority\nRaw or authentic does not automatically mean applicable" {class: design}
review: "Independent method / applicability review\nArchive status matches its policy boundary\nCausal trace narrows compatible histories\nOwner approval matches original duty and acceptance\nMissing stays pending; inconsistent evidence needs review" {class: design}
ascent: "EXISTING ASCENT relation vocabulary\nApplicable + checked -> support and/or counter\nPending means no support, not no conflict\nNew usage/cut preserves complete T/V lineage\nt_use is not actual execution or permission" {class: owner}
aitia: "EXISTING Aitia native request / verifier / stage boundary\nNew captured bundle -> exact current criterion requests\nGenuine content receipts / intended policy / explicit now\nRegistered current failure is not overwritten by a new pass\nNew recovery scenarios are not installed or executed" {class: owner}
reuse: "REC04-REC08 / scoped recovery DESIGN\nKeep original cut, opposing evidence and actual effects\nReopen affected completeness / negative dependencies\nReuse stable V/method/proof content; new A and request bindings\nNo old receipt transfer or unrelated blanket reruns" {class: design}
limit: "Qualification boundary\n18 authored recovery steps / independent oracle controls\nExternal authority/history, issuer trust and capture still need tests\nGate result does not authorize or atomically bind actual use\nNo implementation or performance/productivity claim" {class: boundary}
library -> agent
agent -> arrival
arrival -> review -> ascent -> aitia -> reuse -> limit
reuse -> agent: "Further investigation remains agent-chosen" {style.stroke-dash: 5}
